{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "00f08bbcc81087dc8861ef8c0e44a5b66ff7b63ed712ad32955c2fe53cbc45fb", "ja": "グランプリを目指して", "zh": "目标是大奖赛", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fdf67fbac4ebba0aeadc9e3e92595d4292e9e1a53e4f08902a95580735394430", "ja": "一大イベント『ネクスト・アイドル・ウェー\nブ』の招待枠を競い、ユニットを組む事にな\nった未来、静香、翼。センターも決まる事務\n所内オーディションに熱意を燃やす静香と翼\nだが、未来はどこかボンヤリしていた。", "zh": "为了争夺重大活动“下一代偶像浪潮”\n的受邀名额，未来、静香和翼组成\n了组合。对于同时决定C位人选的事务\n所内部选拔，静香和翼满怀热情，\n但未来却有些心不在焉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1000_015siz", "source_sha256": "6eced207f5962c14a6c4293167da84b5395d43217a8316523a397afb30fd4dcb", "ja": "ネクスト・アイドル・ウェーブ？", "zh": "下一代偶像浪潮？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6eced207f5962c14a6c4293167da84b5395d43217a8316523a397afb30fd4dcb", "ja": "ネクスト・アイドル・ウェーブ？", "zh": "下一代偶像浪潮？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "c99b7f72e698b10bb26be978e2068ce1ea3c491f847375d75d406bad866df874", "ja": "ネクスト・アイドル・水泳部？", "zh": "下一位偶像·游泳部？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "adee8d7672d3ada1577e530b33b46172771b44aa4e53b88363cc210dbdd6c666", "ja": "そう。\nネクスト・アイドル・ウェーブだ！", "zh": "没错。\n是Next Idol Wave（下一个偶像浪潮）！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "e4d7d62e850d39a1a21278d2b144cb200afa2801f6ae21cf4c39c0b55460a50b", "ja": "あ！　もしかして、海でイベントですか？\nスイカ割りしたり、ヒトデ拾って遊んだり♪", "zh": "啊！难道说，是在海边办活动吗？\n比如打西瓜、捡海星玩之类的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "f8f89cfb34523e6c1af4ec67b12a5ffcfb20a3faa5f6be79e96e75b2e542e56d", "ja": "アイドル水泳部じゃないわ、未来。\nネクスト・アイドル・ウェーブ！", "zh": "不是偶像游泳部啦，未来。下一波偶像浪潮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5b5b0e310eec287b06c7d47ec96c3460c2dc4d9cf9b0f438b044277c1b88e6ba", "ja": "静香ちゃん、よく今のでわかったねー。", "zh": "静香，你居然能马上明白啊——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "711512fd4f5a77f78f49c719045a731120375f30af8ca5351e5fb1e8e3b69b6c", "ja": "未来の考えそうなことは、何となくね。", "zh": "未来会想些什么，我大概能猜到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e6eb25659c00f16e7f00763ef34f99660a0df4626125f16f201fd5bac292f715", "ja": "ネクスト・アイドル・ウェーブ……昨日からすっごく\nニュースになってるから、気になってたんですよね～。", "zh": "Next·偶像·Wave……昨天开始就在新闻里被大肆报道，所以我一直很在意呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "9479d9efc1bc2ce50cb35d6e487c0dbd6fde0b63fd196a323fbee1cdefaa4d59", "ja": "確か、世界中から様々な経歴のアイドルが集まる\nアイドルの祭典……ですよね。", "zh": "如果我没记错的话，这是一个汇聚了来自世界各地、拥有各种经历的偶像们的盛典……对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "0b7daf4a72d2e373b38975e3144652b36ef127f2260afca84cb5a9201bfa320f", "ja": "なんでも、グランプリを取ったアイドルには、\n世界デビューが約束されているとか……。", "zh": "听说，获得大奖的偶像，就能进军世界……是这样吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "e0788185fd5ffc456ca3c2a72e1c83bef601861a4506db1be05f79df3ff4f263", "ja": "ええっ、世界デビュー！？\nすっごーい！", "zh": "诶，世界出道！？\n好厉害——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "829d13cfd0dcdc9eefc38f977e13b4bf3fa16d8fe4bea4bc40443e8f0af6c4e1", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　わたしたちも、\nネクスト・アイドル・ウェーブに出られるんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！我们也能参加下一届偶像浪潮吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "7ca2a1c25754dbf2dae45faa8f4e5186db465836ae4d32dd117ff86d77fa44da", "ja": "もしかして、この3人で！？", "zh": "难道说，要由我们3个人参加吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ff6ec633d66ba59d82634ec98474f96521d25f1a10ba8730c34a54486a4c4341", "ja": "たしかに、3人をここに呼んだのは、\nその話をしようと思ってたからだけど……。", "zh": "确实，把3人叫到这里来，就是因为我想谈谈那件事，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e0425947035be8a56b8f7970b812aea57fa6b8c2db79d3e3afec52a485525ade", "ja": "まだ、必ず出場できると決まったわけじゃないんだ。", "zh": "还没确定一定能参加呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6e58778b104513048cae2949a0591a4f250afadfdabd3f9be9a5c801feb3819f", "ja": "え～っ、そうなんですか？", "zh": "诶～，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4ca93c06712b1b1978b0ae4767d10d783c7ca6fee7d7868b8e5a56cb8699b4d1", "ja": "765プロに来た招待枠は、3。\n個人で、もしくはユニットで3組までだ。", "zh": "给765艺能的邀请名额是3个。\n个人或者组合，最多3组。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "09affeec26f4501b7f0c48258a63b78180944c50c1f61b2e5f8af96589cc99e2", "ja": "そこで、事務所内オーディションを行って\n出場ユニットを決めることになった。", "zh": "因此，我们决定在事务所内进行选拔，确定参赛组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c1722bd4ca96b80dec4859907cdff431b5cc82cb4144bda21d6380064a961317", "ja": "未来、静香、翼。\n3人の新しいユニットで、挑戦してみないか？", "zh": "未来、静香、翼。要不要组成3人的新组合，挑战一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "482eae606f879e821a8fd6bc451f18d2f992ddda43bd712c76e7c6df7d7cda75", "ja": "わぁ……私と静香ちゃんと翼で、ユニットですか！？\nふたりとも仲良しだし、うれしいかも～！　えへへ♪", "zh": "哇……要由我、静香酱和翼组成组合吗！？\n我们两个关系也很好，我可能会很开心～！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "67d6614e0ffac7b6bb6ad1520190cffbab70acd8b98a4cfe30c6f9036cc5d457", "ja": "でも、事務所内オーディションか～。\nなんだか大変そう。", "zh": "不过，是事务所内部的试镜啊～。\n总觉得好像会很辛苦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "7adcbd60ec148d51c8e390ab17adc64189d656865de6bf9e4548d8df33124d92", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。私たちは、\nユニットでの挑戦って言いましたけど……。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。虽说我们\n提过要以组合的形式去挑战……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "a73640adf110160e97ff9a5f4e6e62837e11a937d08fcb5765205c5b58921a7d", "ja": "グランプリは、たしか\n個人が受賞する可能性もあるんですよね？", "zh": "大奖赛，好像也有可能由个人获奖，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "fb2d9e4e69a45e4b606549f0245bfc5638443f24e006a21e8c2e6cbbe2fbb779", "ja": "ユニットで勝ち残ったとしても。最後は、\nメンバーがライバルになる可能性もある……。", "zh": "即使以组合的形式胜出。最后，成员之间也可能成为竞争对手……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "8e3564e0b9666aec07ad84f44d8f00cab008110420e226a8ed723d7c46768f95", "ja": "ああ、そのとおりだ。ユニットで出場しても、\nグランプリはユニット全員が対象とは限らない。", "zh": "啊，正是如此。即使以组合名义参赛，\n大奖也不一定是组合全员都有份。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "418893d035895f5789873f2f77be877a26452d7aad2121776c60f7241f38a5d6", "ja": "ユニットとしての賞はもらえても、\nグランプリは個人。そういう可能性もある。", "zh": "即使能获得组合奖，大奖也可能只面向个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9765d6dc187e500f8da435d14dfd6af1ec28cde39b21c5b3174c81557e5b57bd", "ja": "そっかー。じゃあユニットでも、\nちゃんと目立つようにがんばらないとなんですね。", "zh": "这样啊——那么就算是组合，也得努力让组合好好地受到关注才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "511ec72a321a89eca004b0fe85a980d5e6b309fa1cc66de9ab297e1374a7dce2", "ja": "この3人でユニットを組むとしてセンターは誰ですか？\nセンターが一番、審査員にも観客にも見られますよね。", "zh": "由这3个人组成组合的话，谁来当中心位？\n中心位最容易被评委和观众看到，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "91bcb882e4134dfccea7602b5bc8224f4ab4560e3122545829a221b1fdb18685", "ja": "グランプリを狙うなら、\nまずはユニットのセンターにならなきゃ。", "zh": "如果要争夺大奖，\n首先得成为组合的C位才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "de0cf41d1caa69248acc0d126bd21f6c5ed63a40ea452f3ee773e0c1185ce4d1", "ja": "静香ちゃん、ズル～イ！\nそれならわたしだって、センターになりたい！", "zh": "静香好狡猾～！那样的话，我也想当中心位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "2620c8b9a6e3bb335767545335d1df48f80b1ee465e7e5e7b3a04d680a85dee7", "ja": "そのことだけど……センターは、事務所内の\n選抜オーディション結果で決めようと思ってる。", "zh": "关于那件事……中心位，我想根据事务所内部选拔试镜的结果来决定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3a4cfdbfe8b4a6c05f2b83c857f7a95bd4d4fb537f77a16b1068262ef7b7b7c5", "ja": "ネクスト・アイドル・ウェーブに出られるかどうか\n決まるオーディションで、センターも決まっちゃうの？", "zh": "在决定能不能参加“新偶像浪潮”的试镜中，连C位也会一起决定吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "22778a10c6a6b7ff4454572eb68b423153cbd35a858745519217db7556fea833", "ja": "ああ。事務所内オーディションはライブ形式……\n一般のお客さんも入れて行う予定だ。", "zh": "啊。事务所内的选拔赛将采用演唱会形式……\n计划让普通观众也入场观看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1034_p", "source_sha256": "06f5f15c8dc5b86da9f37e52638f580e90ef3ec578bdc40763693b282d3baebf", "ja": "そのオーディションで一番、観客や審査員から\n評価された者を、このユニットのセンターにする。", "zh": "在这场选拔中，最受观众和评委认可的人，将成为这个组合的中心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "733e73be7b02219dfada2932e0204f17df347033549ff24806e64bbbabf3e448", "ja": "これなら公平だと思うけど、どうだ？", "zh": "这样应该就公平了，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "425fa5a94817e06fb297c9279372673492a2563fffb9c4566083e156c91f0132", "ja": "そうですね。\nそれなら、私は文句ありません。", "zh": "是啊。\n那样的话，我没有意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1037_016tsu", "source_sha256": "32e9eb998adc3744a4c7898ac982cd7f3858c013d762a1dd081d670e56881f4f", "ja": "わたしももちろんいいよ。\n絶対にわたしが勝っちゃうけどね♪", "zh": "我当然也没问题啦。\n不过肯定会是我赢哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1038_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c0360d65935b3eccabd82b91a259b7759cf3cd26f58fbd34da0345a254521bcd", "ja": "未来は？\nセンターを決める方法、これでいい？", "zh": "未来呢？\n决定C位的方法，这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1039_014mir", "source_sha256": "1064e1687ceeca94d8e1810a15a26f4009d9bf11af7387a29e2957496a77e354", "ja": "静香ちゃんと翼がいいなら、いいんじゃないかな？\nたぶん、静香ちゃんか翼がセンターだし……。", "zh": "静香和翼觉得这样可以的话，那应该就没问题吧？\n大概会是静香或者翼当C位吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1040_015siz", "source_sha256": "4ba79ffff796769d4683b249d39678cfe4bc0df46ed90a9a62d87a195189874c", "ja": "……もう、なんか拍子抜けする。\n未来はセンターになりたくないの？", "zh": "……真是的，总觉得有点扫兴。\n未来不想当C位吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "ec555958bf3c8c125ba1fdda00d6941b59e5bc4d5ffb5c5b75d1467308adc536", "ja": "うーん……。ふたりとユニットを組めるのは\n楽しみだけど、別にセンターじゃなくてもいいかも。", "zh": "嗯……能和她们两个组成组合，我是很期待啦，但不当C位好像也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1042_014mir", "source_sha256": "3ca2df3b2c287aa4d89001844e0cf25775c1602f5060b50acaea091eedcd1ec7", "ja": "っていうか、私じゃたぶん、\n静香ちゃんと翼には勝てないと思うしな～。", "zh": "话说回来，我觉得我大概赢不了静香和翼，所以嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_01_1043_015siz", "source_sha256": "13136dc5943fb3b1507c9ca2ef09ff8ca045b9ef6f092fb80aa7e19ff4567b47", "ja": "何を弱気になっているの。ネクスト・アイドル・\nウェーブに出る以上、目指すはグランプリ、でしょ？", "zh": "你怎么突然泄气了。既然要参加Next・偶像・\nWave，目标当然是大奖赛冠军，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
